  1651                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  1652                              <1> ; measure_clock -> [ST_MHZ] (MHz x 10): a timing loop of 32 DIVs per
  1653                              <1> ; pass is built in RAM (0:7C00) and timed by PIT channel 2. The setup
  1654                              <1> ; uses 8 DIVs per pass; the longer pass makes the reading much less
  1655                              <1> ; sensitive to slow code fetches while the cache is still off (early in
  1656                              <1> ; POST). A reading not within 1/16 of a standard clock is not shown.
  1657                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  1658                              <1> measure_clock:
