  1816                              <1> ; =====================================================================
  1817                              <1> section lba start=0x2C00 vstart=0x3292
  1818                              <1> ; =====================================================================
  1819                              <1> ; INT 13h extensions (EDD 1.1 subset) for the hard disks 80h/81h:
  1820                              <1> ;   41h installation check, 42h extended read, 43h extended write,
  1821                              <1> ;   44h verify, 47h seek (no-op), 48h drive parameters.
  1822                              <1> ; Sectors are addressed as CHS through the drive's physical geometry (the
  1823                              <1> ; FDPT at INT 41h/46h, as AMI's own code does) as long as the request
  1824                              <1> ; stays inside it, and as 28-bit LBA beyond it.  The transfer is polled
  1825                              <1> ; PIO, one command per request (up to 127 sectors).  Entered from AMI's
  1826                              <1> ; INT 13h handler at A3E7 (patched to JMP bu_int13).
  1827                              <1> ; Frame: BP -> ES DS DI SI BP SP BX DX CX AX (PUSHA order) ; locals below.
  1828                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  1829                              <1> bu_int13:
